agents-orchestrator tag v7.13.0 (commit f9fafed, T-116 plan relay), /agent/v1 paths only (method + operationId). Re-vendored from its openapi.json: for each path starting with /agent/v1 write {"paths": {path: {method: {"operationId": id}}}} with sorted keys and indent 1. No operation changes against v7.12.0: the plan relay paths are served by the existing /agent/v1/specs/{path} catch-all.